      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Now, *most* hero turns, no one will be damaging Nightmist.&nbsp; But she can definitely redirect the first damage to her during the environment turn *and* the villain turn.</p><p>Of course, if she has lots of cards, and there are few enemy targets in play, she might just say, &quot;Hey Haka, why don&#39;t you use Taiaha to hit the bad guy and ME; then I&#39;ll redirect my damage to the bad guy.&quot;&nbsp; Or similar tricks with other heroes who do multi-target damage.</p><p>EDIT: And of course, if anything damages her doing her own turn, she can redirect that.&nbsp; Including using her own base power: net effect, trade two (presumably non-awesome) cards for two new cards *and* do two points of damage!</p>",
